U8ASM 1
NAME "vramtest"
; UNIVERSAL-8 original-compatible VRAM test / visual demo
; PC 01: walking P0 pixel over all 64 cells
; PC 02..05: horizontal, vertical, X, checkerboard on P0
; PC 06: direct readback verification of all 64 P0 DFFs
; PC 07..10: border, smiley, full fill, pixel-by-pixel clear
; PC 12: walking P1 pixel; PC 13 checkerboard P1; PC 14 verify all P1 DFFs
; PC 15..17: X/fill/clear on P1
; PC 19+20: combined P0 border + P1 X
; PC 23: PASS (V). PC 26: FAIL (X)
